---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Brazos Ridge Fence Co."
  description="How Brazos Ridge Fence Co. collects, uses, and protects the information you share with us through our website and estimate request form."
  canonical="https://brazosridgefence.com/privacy/"
>

<section style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 24px 80px;">
  <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);color:#2A2724;margin-bottom:8px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p style="font-size:14px;color:#8a8378;margin-bottom:36px;">Last updated: July 25, 2026</p>

  <div class="legal-body">
    <p>Brazos Ridge Fence Co. ("we," "us," or "our") operates brazosridgefence.com. This page explains what information we collect when you use our website, how we use it, and the choices you have.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you request an estimate through our contact form or call us, we collect the details you provide: typically your name, phone number, email address, property location, and a description of the fencing work you need.</p>
    <p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, we use analytics (Google Analytics 4) to understand how visitors use the site — pages viewed, approximate location, device type, and how you found us. IP addresses are anonymized. This data is aggregated and does not identify you personally.</p>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To respond to your estimate request and communicate about your project</li>
      <li>To schedule site visits and provide written quotes</li>
      <li>To improve our website and understand which services people are looking for</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. We do not use your information for marketing lists you didn't ask to join.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>Our contact form is processed by Formspree, which transmits your submission to us by email. Analytics are provided by Google Analytics. Each of these providers has its own privacy policy governing how they handle data.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>The site uses a small number of cookies for analytics purposes. You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings without affecting your ability to browse the site or request an estimate by phone.</p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>We keep estimate requests and project correspondence for as long as needed to serve you and meet our business and legal obligations, then delete them.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can contact us at any time to ask what information we hold about you, request a correction, or ask us to delete it. Email <a href="mailto:info@brazosridgefence.com">info@brazosridgefence.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+15093518404">(509) 351-8404</a>.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>Our website and services are directed at adult landowners. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone under 18.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we update this policy, we'll post the new version here with a revised date at the top.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Brazos Ridge Fence Co.<br>Waco, TX<br><a href="mailto:info@brazosridgefence.com">info@brazosridgefence.com</a><br><a href="tel:+15093518404">(509) 351-8404</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .legal-body h2 { font-size: 20px; color: #2A2724; margin: 36px 0 12px; }
  .legal-body p, .legal-body li { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .legal-body ul { padding-left: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .legal-body a { color: #A6491F; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .legal-body a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>

</Layout>
